  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Umuoma Cassava Processing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide UIYFCS with adequate capital to create a revolving loan fund; purchase vehicles; equipment; and inputs necessary to accelerate sustainable and profitable growth of their operations and meet local cassava demand.</narrative>
